# 38. Juice Shop-Specific Recon Checklist

## Target

* [ ] Juice Shop started successfully
* [ ] Target URL documented
* [ ] Target IP documented where applicable
* [ ] Port identified
* [ ] HTTP service identified
* [ ] Service/version fingerprinted

## Application

* [ ] Homepage mapped
* [ ] Main routes identified
* [ ] Login identified
* [ ] Registration identified
* [ ] Search identified
* [ ] Basket identified
* [ ] Checkout identified
* [ ] Profile identified
* [ ] Reviews identified
* [ ] Feedback functionality identified
* [ ] Administrative functionality investigated

## API

* [ ] API requests captured
* [ ] API endpoints documented
* [ ] HTTP methods documented
* [ ] Query parameters documented
* [ ] JSON parameters documented
* [ ] Authentication requirements documented
* [ ] API response structures reviewed
* [ ] Object identifiers identified

## Client-Side

* [ ] JavaScript bundles identified
* [ ] Routes reviewed
* [ ] API references searched
* [ ] Interesting keywords searched
* [ ] Client-side storage reviewed
* [ ] Source files reviewed

## HTTP

* [ ] HTTP headers captured
* [ ] HTTP methods identified
* [ ] Cookies identified
* [ ] Content types identified
* [ ] CORS behavior recorded
* [ ] Security headers recorded
* [ ] Redirect behavior recorded
* [ ] OPTIONS response reviewed

## Public Resources

* [ ] `/robots.txt`
* [ ] `/sitemap.xml`
* [ ] `/security.txt`
* [ ] `/.well-known/security.txt`
* [ ] `/favicon.ico`
* [ ] Other exposed resources

## Discovery

* [ ] Burp Site Map populated
* [ ] Burp HTTP History reviewed
* [ ] Endpoint inventory created
* [ ] Parameter inventory created
* [ ] Authentication boundary mapped
* [ ] Attack surface diagram created

## Evidence

* [ ] Initial response captured
* [ ] HTTP headers screenshot
* [ ] Burp Site Map screenshot
* [ ] HTTP History screenshot
* [ ] API request screenshot
* [ ] API response screenshot
* [ ] JavaScript evidence captured
* [ ] Endpoint inventory completed
* [ ] Findings table updated

